# Frontend React

## API

`frontend/src/api.ts`: `API = "/api"`; use `getJson` helpers. Vite proxies `/api` → backend (`vite.config.ts`, default `127.0.0.1:8000`).

## State and hash

`App.tsx` owns project, view, selection, explore expansion. URL hash encodes deep links (`explore/hash.ts`); `hashchange` syncs pasted links.

## Graph UI

React Flow in `flow.ts`; layouts: ELK (`explore/layoutExplore.ts`), dagre (`layout.ts`). Trace highlighting in `trace.ts`.

## Quality

ESLint type-aware on `src/**`; Prettier 120 cols. Fix `@typescript-eslint/no-floating-promises` with `await` or `void`. Vitest in `src/**/*.test.ts`.

Details: `docs/ai/frontend-guide.md`.
